==English==

===Etymology===
From {{inh|en|enm|hors her}}, {{m|enm|horshere}}, {{m|enm|hors-here}}, {{m|enm|hors heer}} (also {{m|enm|hors-hore}}), equivalent to {{af|en|horse|hair}}. Compare {{cog|non|hross-hár|t=horsehair}}.

===Noun===
{{en-noun|~}}

# The [[hair]] of a [[horse]], especially from the [[mane]] and [[tail]], used for [[upholstery]].
# A [[fabric]] made from this.
#: {{synonyms|en|haircloth}}

====Derived terms====
* [[horsehair shirt]]
* {{l|en|horsehair worm}}
* {{l|en|horsehairy}}

